    {
      "id": "dxv50js",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "4. BRAHMO SAMAJ — DETAILED ANALYSIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ahmruac",
      "content": "• Founded as Brahma Sabha (1828)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "f9fidf3",
      "content": "• Influenced by Upanishads and Unitarianism."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yp1tja9",
      "content": "• Abolition of Sati (1829) during Bentinck’s tenure."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bz4vyqw",
      "content": "• Advocated widow remarriage &amp; women education."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vni43gj",
      "content": "• Split into Adi Brahmo Samaj (Debendranath Tagore) and Brahmo Samaj of India (Keshab Chandra Sen)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "awegzae",
      "content": "• Encouraged modern journalism (Sambad Kaumudi)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3z3hpgd",
      "content": "• Criticism: limited urban reach."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "CHAPTER 15 : SOCIO-RELIGIOUS REFORM MOVEMENTS",
      "id": "ap93r8z"
    },
    {
      "id": "5rlfqqd",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "5. ARYA SAMAJ — DETAILED ANALYSIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gkbz4kc",
      "content": "• Book: Satyarth Prakash."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "huyxvjp",
      "content": "• Rejected idol worship and caste by birth."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "f9z7ljs",
      "content": "• Promoted Shuddhi (reconversion) movement."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rkwjq2y",
      "content": "• Established DAV institutions and Gurukul Kangri."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dxdabfa",
      "content": "• Advocated Vedic infallibility."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "x98w890",
      "content": "• Played role in nationalist and cow-protection movements."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5zzgn2u",
      "content": "• Criticism: revivalist rigidity."
    },
    {
      "id": "wlfl2dn",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "6. ALIGARH MOVEMENT — DETAILED ANALYSIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "jsw8wt1",
      "content": "• Founded Scientific Society (1864)."
    },
