      "level": 3,
      "content": "10. IMPACT & LIMITATIONS (ANALYTICAL)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "omspa2h",
      "content": "• Created foundation for modern Indian nationalism."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "aej583k",
      "content": "• Encouraged critical thinking and modern education."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ig9i1wr",
      "content": "• Limited largely to urban middle class."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "z48a01a",
      "content": "• Sometimes fostered communal differentiation."
    },
